{"prototypeToken":{"displayName":20,"displayBars":20,"flags":{"pf2e":{"linkToActorSize":true,"autoscale":false}},"height":1,"width":1,"name":"Spellfilcher","actorLink":false,"texture":{"src":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/tokens/spellfilcher.webp","scaleX":2,"scaleY":2,"tint":"#ffffff","anchorX":0.5,"anchorY":0.5,"fit":"contain","alphaThreshold":0.75},"lockRotation":false,"rotation":0,"alpha":1,"disposition":-1,"bar1":{"attribute":"attributes.hp"},"bar2":{"attribute":null},"light":{"alpha":0.5,"angle":360,"bright":0,"color":null,"coloration":1,"dim":0,"attenuation":0.5,"luminosity":0.5,"saturation":0,"contrast":0,"shadows":0,"animation":{"type":null,"speed":5,"intensity":5,"reverse":false},"darkness":{"min":0,"max":1},"negative":false,"priority":0},"sight":{"enabled":false,"range":0,"angle":360,"visionMode":"basic","color":null,"attenuation":0.1,"brightness":0,"saturation":0,"contrast":0},"detectionModes":{},"randomImg":false,"appendNumber":false,"prependAdjective":false,"occludable":{"radius":0},"ring":{"enabled":true,"colors":{"ring":null,"background":null},"effects":1,"subject":{"scale":2,"texture":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/subjects/spellfilcher.webp"}},"turnMarker":{"mode":1,"animation":null,"src":null,"disposition":false},"movementAction":null,"depth":1},"name":"Spellfilcher","type":"npc","effects":[],"system":{"attributes":{"hp":{"value":42,"temp":0,"max":42,"details":""},"ac":{"value":18,"details":""},"allSaves":{"value":""},"speed":{"value":20,"otherSpeeds":[{"type":"fly","value":45}],"details":""},"weaknesses":[{"type":"cold-iron","value":5,"exceptions":[]}]},"initiative":{"statistic":"perception"},"details":{"languages":{"value":["common","draconic","fey"],"details":""},"level":{"value":3},"blurb":"","publicNotes":"<p>Spellfilchers are a small type of fey that delight in mischief. They seem to have an innate understanding of which minor magics would be missed the most if they were gone. Spellfilchers claim to be born out of the jealousy of the magically inept for more skilled magicians. If this is true, it means that more powerful spellfilchers likely exist, which would be capable of stealing more powerful magic.</p>\n<p>Spellfilchers are tiny creatures that possess the upper half of a colorful dragon that carries a tiny wand, while their lower halves trail off into sparks of mystical energies.</p>\n<p>Spellfilchers treasure their wands. They can replace a lost or stolen wand with one day of work, but they are loathe to do so and bargain dearly to get back a wand that belongs to them.</p>\n<h2>Stealing From A Thief</h2>\n<p>The spellfilcher's fae wand only works for the spellfilcher, so creatures who take one cannot use it to steal spells. However, if the spellfilcher stole a spell and has not cast it yet, the wand functions as a scroll of that spell at the appropriate level and crumbles to dust after casting the spell. Destroying a wand in this way greatly upsets the spellfilcher, so bargaining with it is usually more advantageous.</p>\n<h2>Suggested Monster Parts</h2>\n<p><strong>Monster Parts</strong> 7/18/30 gp</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Refinements</strong> weapons (bludgeoning), armor (light), perception item, skill items (Acrobatics, Arcana, Athletics, Crafting, Deception, Diplomacy, Nature, Occultism, Religion, Society, Stealth, Survival, Thievery)</p>\n<p><strong>Eligible Imbued Properties</strong> bane, chaotic, charisma, cold, dexterity, electricity, energy resistant (positive), intelligence, light, spells (Arcane: dancing lights, detect magic, electric arc, ghost sound, light, prestidigitation, ray of frost, read aura), wild, winged</p>","privateNotes":"","publication":{"title":"Battlezoo Bestiary: Strange and Unusual","authors":"Carlos H. Caro","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"creatureType":""},"resources":{},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"abilities":{"str":{"mod":0},"dex":{"mod":4},"con":{"mod":2},"int":{"mod":4},"wis":{"mod":3},"cha":{"mod":4}},"perception":{"details":"glean magic","mod":10,"senses":[{"type":"low-light-vision"}],"vision":true},"saves":{"fortitude":{"value":7,"saveDetail":""},"reflex":{"value":11,"saveDetail":""},"will":{"value":8,"saveDetail":""}},"skills":{"acrobatics":{"base":9},"arcana":{"base":11},"athletics":{"base":5},"crafting":{"base":9},"deception":{"base":9},"diplomacy":{"base":9},"nature":{"base":8},"occultism":{"base":8},"religion":{"base":8},"society":{"base":9},"stealth":{"base":11},"survival":{"base":8},"thievery":{"base":11}},"traits":{"value":["chaotic","fey"],"rarity":"uncommon","size":{"value":"tiny"}}},"img":"modules/battlezoo-bestiary-su-pf2e/art/Portraits/spellfilcher.webp","items":[{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Low-Light Vision","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>@Localize[PF2E.NPC.Abilities.Glossary.LowLightVision]</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"low-light-vision","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[],"rarity":"common"},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Bestiary","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""},"weapon":{"value":""}},"type":"action","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689099757639,"modifiedTime":1689099757639,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.bestiary-ability-glossary-srd.Item.fFu2sZz4KB01fVRc","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"okasryTGKabYYUfL"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Glean Magic","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The spellfilcher can sense the presence, though not the location, of spellcasters within 60 feet. This is a vague sense.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"p0TQcsUG8xEjrvdZ","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689099825113,"modifiedTime":1689099848776,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Wand Dependence","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A spellfilcher can substitute its wand for any material component it needs to cast a stolen spell. It can't use its Steal Spell or Cast Stolen Spell abilities without its wand.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"interaction","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"M5jhaq9b9qVsNSYy","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689099850101,"modifiedTime":1689099952489,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Spell Siphon","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Trigger</strong> The spellfilcher critically succeeds at a saving throw against a spell</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The spellfilcher attempts to Steal Spell on the triggering spell, without needing to meet the usual requirements.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["arcane"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"reaction"},"category":"defensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"cXqfAL24ZwrNI73l","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689099976326,"modifiedTime":1689100010872,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"melee","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/melee.svg","name":"Fae Wand","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"value":["agile","finesse"],"otherTags":[]},"damageRolls":{"uSq4LNCP5BeEEfcp":{"damage":"1d6+4","damageType":"bludgeoning","category":null}},"bonus":{"value":11},"attackEffects":{"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"_migration":{"version":0.932,"previous":{"schema":null,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}}},"effects":[],"_id":"q3sMGz1LPS3q63tc","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689100024779,"modifiedTime":1689100041446,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"name":"Arcane Innate Spells","type":"spellcastingEntry","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"ability":{"value":"cha"},"spelldc":{"value":12,"dc":20},"tradition":{"value":"arcane"},"prepared":{"value":"innate"},"showSlotlessLevels":{"value":false},"proficiency":{"value":1},"slots":{"slot0":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot1":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot2":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot3":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot4":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot5":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot6":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot7":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot8":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot9":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot10":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0},"slot11":{"prepared":[],"value":0,"max":0}},"autoHeightenLevel":{"value":null},"showUnpreparedSpells":{"value":false},"displayLevels":{}},"_id":"x7W9LZvXqwCpqmNc","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/spellcastingEntry.svg","effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689100051151,"modifiedTime":1689100073974,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/dancing-lights.webp","name":"Dancing Lights","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create up to four floating lights, no two of which are more than 10 feet apart. Each sheds light like a torch. When you Sustain the Spell, you can move any number of lights up to 60 feet. Each light must remain within 120 feet of you and within 10 feet of all others, or it winks out.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"dancing-lights","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","light","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"x7W9LZvXqwCpqmNc"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689100072924,"modifiedTime":1689100072924,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.kl2q6JvBZwed4B6v","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"aTLxI0hMmZXKKCeL"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/detect-magic.webp","name":"Detect Magic","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies.</p>\n<p>You detect illusion magic only if that magic's effect has a lower level than the level of your detect magic spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an invisibility potion) typically are detected normally.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You learn the school of magic for the highest-level effect within range that the spell detects. If multiple effects are equally strong, the GM determines which you learn.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> As 3rd level, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-level magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"detect-magic","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","detection","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":""},"area":{"type":"emanation","value":30},"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"x7W9LZvXqwCpqmNc"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689100078163,"modifiedTime":1689100078163,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gpzpAAAJ1Lza2JVl","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"moRMrPAECFWUmTNO"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/electric-arc.webp","name":"Electric Arc","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>An arc of lightning leaps from one target to another. You deal electricity damage equal to 1d4 plus your spellcasting ability modifier.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"electric-arc","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","electricity","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 or 2 creatures"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":true,"formula":"1d4","type":"electricity","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":{"passive":null,"save":{"statistic":"reflex","basic":true}},"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"x7W9LZvXqwCpqmNc"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d4"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689100079964,"modifiedTime":1689100079964,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.kBhaPuzLUSwS6vVf","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"P6oMzKYLE1OubAvp"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/ghost-sound.webp","name":"Ghost Sound","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You create an auditory illusion of simple sounds that has a maximum volume equal to four normal humans shouting. The sounds emanate from a square you designate within range. You can't create intelligible words or other intricate sounds (such as music).</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> The range increases to 60 feet.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (5th)</strong> The range increases to 120 feet.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"ghost-sound","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["auditory","cantrip","concentrate","illusion","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","occult"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":""},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"x7W9LZvXqwCpqmNc"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"range":{"value":"60 feet"}},"5":{"range":{"value":"120 feet"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689100081299,"modifiedTime":1689100081299,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.atlgGNI1E1Ox3O3a","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"yrXdKXHLbcc1ogv4"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/light.webp","name":"Light","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The object glows, casting bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet) like a torch. If you cast this spell again on a second object, the light spell on the first object ends.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.cVVZXNbV0nElVOPZ]{Spell Effect: Light}</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (4th)</strong> The object sheds bright light in a 60-foot radius (and dim light for the next 60 feet).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"light","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","light","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 object of 1 Bulk or less, either unattended or possessed by you or a willing ally"},"range":{"value":"touch"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"until the next time you make your daily preparations","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"x7W9LZvXqwCpqmNc"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689100082695,"modifiedTime":1689100082695,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.WBmvzNDfpwka3qT4","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"29fLV9V4fkEEjiWv"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/prestidigitation.webp","name":"Prestidigitation","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The simplest magic does your bidding. You can perform simple magical effects for as long as you Sustain the Spell. Each time you Sustain the Spell, you can choose one of four options.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Cook</strong> Cool, warm, or flavor 1 pound of nonliving material.</li>\n<li><strong>Lift</strong> <strong>Slowly</strong> lift an unattended object of light Bulk or less 1 foot off the ground.</li>\n<li><strong>Make</strong> Create a temporary object of negligible Bulk, made of congealed magical substance. The object looks crude and artificial and is extremely fragile-it can't be used as a tool, weapon, or spell component.</li>\n<li><strong>Tidy</strong> Color, clean, or soil an object of light Bulk or less. You can affect an object of 1 Bulk with 10 rounds of concentration, and a larger object a 1 minute per Bulk.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Prestidigitation can't deal damage or cause adverse conditions. Any actual change to an object (beyond what is noted above) persists only as long as you Sustain the Spell.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"prestidigitation","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 object (cook, lift, or tidy only)"},"range":{"value":"10 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":true},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"x7W9LZvXqwCpqmNc"},"counteraction":false},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689100084925,"modifiedTime":1689100084925,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Qw3fnUlaUbnn7ipC","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"IIs1K4zUr7zVRpYn"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/ray-of-frost.webp","name":"Ray of Frost","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You blast an icy ray. Make a spell attack roll. The ray deals cold damage equal to 1d4 + your spellcasting ability modifier.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target takes double damage and takes a -10-foot status penalty to its Speeds for 1 round.</p>\n<p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spell-effects.Item.I4PsUAaYSUJ8pwKC]{Spell Effect: Ray of Frost}</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes normal damage.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The damage increases by 1d4.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"ray-of-frost","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["attack","cantrip","cold","concentrate","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 creature"},"range":{"value":"120 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"2"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{"0":{"applyMod":true,"formula":"1d4","type":"cold","category":null,"materials":[],"kinds":["damage"]}},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"x7W9LZvXqwCpqmNc"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"damage":{"0":"1d4"},"interval":1,"type":"interval"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689100086350,"modifiedTime":1689100086350,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.gYjPm7YwGtEa1oxh","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"friCVuZz5aFtVsvv"},{"img":"systems/pf2e/icons/spells/read-aura.webp","name":"Read Aura","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>You focus on the target object, opening your mind to perceive magical auras. When the casting is complete, you know whether that item is magical, and if it is, you learn the school of magic.</p>\n<p>If the object is illusory, you detect this only if the effect's level is lower than the level of your read aura spell.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (3rd)</strong> You can target up to 10 objects.</p>\n<p><strong>Heightened (6th)</strong> You can target any number of objects.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":"read-aura","_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["cantrip","concentrate","detection","manipulate"],"rarity":"common","traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"]},"publication":{"title":"Pathfinder Core Rulebook","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"level":{"value":1},"requirements":"","target":{"value":"1 object"},"range":{"value":"30 feet"},"area":null,"time":{"value":"1 Minute"},"duration":{"value":"","sustained":false},"damage":{},"defense":null,"cost":{"value":""},"location":{"value":"x7W9LZvXqwCpqmNc"},"counteraction":false,"heightening":{"levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"10 objects"}},"6":{"target":{"value":"any number of objects"}}},"type":"fixed"}},"type":"spell","flags":{"core":{}},"effects":[],"folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689100087751,"modifiedTime":1689100087751,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":"Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.OhD2Z6rIGGD5ocZA","duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"2Acv2FSxboHO2vbw"},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Cast Stolen Spell","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>A spellfilcher can use the Cast a Spell activity with any spell it has stolen, regardless of the source or tradition. It then loses the stolen spell. A spell cast this way gains the trait corresponding to the magical tradition of the spell's original source. For example, even though a spellfilcher's innate spells are normally arcane, if a spellfilcher steals <em>@Compendium[pf2e.spells-srd.y6rAdMK6EFlV6U0t]{Burning Hands}</em> from a druid and casts it, the spell would have the primal trait instead of the arcane trait.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":null},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"z18GZibBTsVzCYuo","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689100105173,"modifiedTime":1689100136416,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Feather Strike","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p>The spellfilcher gently taps its wand against a creature with its fae wand in a way that doesn't damage them and is almost impossible to notice. It makes an attack roll, uses its attack bonus with its fae wand of +11, but dealing no damage. If the spellfilcher is @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.Hidden]{Hidden}, @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.VRSef5y1LmL2Hkjf]{Undetected}, or @Compendium[pf2e.conditionitems.9evPzg9E6muFcoSk]{Unnoticed}, it remains hidden, undetected, or unnoticed after using Feather Strike (as well as Steal Spell, if the spellfilcher uses Steal Spell after Feather Strike).</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":[]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"3HdCSVlJbSv2iST2","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689100144093,"modifiedTime":1689100209577,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}},{"type":"action","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/default-icons/action.svg","name":"Steal Spell","system":{"description":{"gm":"","value":"<p><strong>Requirements</strong> The spellfilcher's last action was to Strike or Feather Strike a creature with its fae wand</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Effect</strong> The spellfilcher steals a spell from the creature it struck. The spellfilcher chooses a spell prepared by the creature or in the repertoire of that creature. If the spell was prepared, the creature must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:22] save or lose that prepared spell. If the creature casts spells spontaneously, it must attempt a @Check[type:will|dc:22] save or lose a spell slot of the appropriate level. The spellfilcher can only steal a 1st or 2nd level spell this way. A spellfilcher can store up to three stolen 1st-level spells and three stolen 2nd-level spells at the same time. A spellfilcher can't steal cantrips.</p>"},"rules":[],"slug":null,"_migration":{"version":0.932,"lastMigration":null,"previous":{"schema":0.853,"foundry":"12.328","system":"6.1.0"}},"traits":{"otherTags":[],"value":["arcane"]},"publication":{"title":"","authors":"","license":"OGL","remaster":false},"actionType":{"value":"action"},"category":"offensive","actions":{"value":1},"deathNote":false,"requirements":{"value":""},"trigger":{"value":""}},"effects":[],"_id":"AuObpVp0n324gFTO","folder":null,"sort":0,"ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"5.1.2","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1689100216542,"modifiedTime":1689100250282,"lastModifiedBy":"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null}}],"flags":{},"_stats":{"systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"6.1.0","coreVersion":"14.360","createdTime":1685401626117,"modifiedTime":1736542893804,"lastModifiedBy":"l2rbNx2a8f5ocpeL","compendiumSource":null,"duplicateSource":null,"exportSource":null},"_id":"DsCgS2vd6b2PfP3i","folder":"3x5VQ7TD4gePAtOj","ownership":{"default":0,"W75cDAmGcgt3X6Rq":3},"sort":0}